/* Poppy Christmas gift chain. Mirrors the Robin/Bailey shape:
     shopping centre purchase -> "_unwrapped" flag -> bedroom wrap -> give in person.

   Differences from the siblings:
     - Romanced Poppy only ($poppyromance gte 0), so the gate lives on the shop link.
     - Poppy has no orphanage bedroom visit, so the handover is a menu option that shows up in BOTH the flat and the lake menus (whichever the player reaches first).
     - The window is the whole $christmas season (Dec 18-25) rather than the 25th alone, because Poppy's schedule can put them out of reach on any given day. */

:: Shop Poppy Gift
<<effects>>
You walk between shops, looking for something Poppy would like. You find a few items you think would work.
<br><br>
<<if $money gte 1200>>
	<<gifticon "christmas">><<link [[Detangler brush (Sensible <<printmoney 1200>>)|Shop Poppy Christmas]]>><<pass 10>><<money -1200>><<set $christmas_gift_poppy to "brush_unwrapped">><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You could buy a detangler brush here, <span class="blue">if you had more money (<<printmoney 1200>>).</span>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $money gte 3500>>
	<<techicon "camera">><<link [[Polaroid camera (Sensible <<printmoney 3500>>)|Shop Poppy Christmas]]>><<pass 10>><<money -3500>><<set $christmas_gift_poppy to "camera_unwrapped">><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You could buy a polaroid camera here, <span class="blue">if you had more money (<<printmoney 3500>>).</span>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $money gte 10000>>
	<<gifticon "christmas">><<link [[Perfume (Exotic <<printmoney 10000>>)|Shop Poppy Christmas]]>><<pass 10>><<money -10000>><<set $christmas_gift_poppy to "perfume_unwrapped">><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You could buy a bottle of perfume here, <span class="blue">if you had more money (<<printmoney 10000>>).</span>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $money gte 42000>>
	<<gifticon "tuxedo">><<link [[Tuxedo suit (Exotic <<printmoney 42000>>)|Shop Poppy Christmas]]>><<pass 10>><<money -42000>><<set $christmas_gift_poppy to "tuxedo_unwrapped">><</link>>
	<<if C.npc?.Poppy?.pronoun is "f">><<note "Poppy might not be expecting something cut like this." "italic">><</if>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You could buy a tuxedo suit here, <span class="blue">if you had more money (<<printmoney 42000>>).</span>
	<br>
<</if>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Shopping Centre]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Shop Poppy Christmas
<<effects>>
<<switch $christmas_gift_poppy>>
	<<case "brush_unwrapped">>You buy the detangler brush. You think Poppy will like it.
	<<case "camera_unwrapped">>You buy the polaroid camera. You think Poppy will like it.
	<<case "perfume_unwrapped">>You buy the perfume. You think Poppy will like it.
	<<case "tuxedo_unwrapped">>You buy the tuxedo suit. You think Poppy will like it.
<</switch>>
<<if $christmas_wrap is undefined>>Now you just need wrapping paper.<<else>>You can wrap it in your room.<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Shopping Centre]]>><</link>>

/* Wrapping inside Poppy's own flat.
Reachable from any room; the orphanage version below covers players who can't get through the door yet. */
:: Flats Poppy Wrap Gift
<<set $location to "flats">><<set $outside to 0>>
<<effects>><<wearProp "giftbox">><<run poppySchedule()>>
<<if $poppyFlat.home>>
	You slip into the quiet of the empty room and shut the door behind you, listening for Poppy moving about elsewhere in the flat.
<<else>>
	With Poppy out, you have the flat to yourself.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<switch $christmas_gift_poppy>>
	<<case "brush">>
		With the wrapping paper and marker in hand, you prepare Poppy's detangler brush.
	<<case "camera">>
		With the wrapping paper and marker in hand, you prepare Poppy's polaroid camera.
	<<case "perfume">>
		With the wrapping paper and marker in hand, you prepare Poppy's perfume.
	<<case "tuxedo">>
		With the wrapping paper and marker in hand, you prepare Poppy's tuxedo suit.
<</switch>>
You wrap it as carefully as you can, keeping one ear on the door. The gift has a fetching look to it once done, with Poppy's name scrawled across one surface.
<br><br>
You tuck the parcel out of sight until you're ready to hand it over.
<br><br>
<<poppyFlatContents>>

:: Bedroom Poppy Wrap
<<effects>><<wearProp "giftbox">>
<<switch $christmas_gift_poppy>>
	<<case "brush">>
		With the wrapping paper and marker in hand, you prepare Poppy's detangler brush.
	<<case "camera">>
		With the wrapping paper and marker in hand, you prepare Poppy's polaroid camera.
	<<case "perfume">>
		With the wrapping paper and marker in hand, you prepare Poppy's perfume.
	<<case "tuxedo">>
		With the wrapping paper and marker in hand, you prepare Poppy's tuxedo suit.
<</switch>>
You wrap it as carefully as you can. The gift has a fetching look to it once done, with Poppy's name scrawled across one surface.
<br><br>
You tuck the parcel away where the other orphans won't get curious about it. You'll have to carry it to Poppy yourself.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Bedroom]]>><</link>>
<br>

/* Handover.
Reached from either menu; $location tells us which one, since the flat passages set it to "flats" and the lake ones to "lake". */
:: Poppy Christmas Gift
<<set _poppyGiftAtFlat to poppyGiftAtFlat()>>
<<effects>><<if !_poppyGiftAtFlat>><<lakeeffects>><</if>><<run poppySchedule()>>
<<set $christmas_gift_poppy_given to 1>>
<<set _poppyGiftLow to (T.poppyStatus and T.poppyStatus.includes("LowPatience"))>>
<<run markPoppyInteraction()>>
<<if $christmas_gift_poppy is "tuxedo" and _poppyGiftLow and C.npc.Poppy.pronoun is "f">>
	"Merry Christmas," you say, and hand Poppy the Christmas gift.
	<br><br>
	Poppy takes it from your hand without a word and opens it.
	<br><br>
	Poppy pauses when <<he>> sees the suit. <<He>> looks extremely disappointed. "Did you... get my gift mixed up with someone else's?" You shake your head.
	<br><br>
	"Oh. Well, thanks..."
	<<npcincr Poppy love -6>><<lllove>><<npcincr Poppy patience -8>><<lllpatience>>
	<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
	<<poppyChristmasGiftReturn>>
<<else>>
	"Merry Christmas," you say, and hand Poppy the Christmas gift.
	<br><br>
	<<His>> face lights up with joy. "Merry Christmas to you too, my jewel!" Poppy takes the gift from your hand and opens it up with great care.
	<br><br>
	<<switch $christmas_gift_poppy>>
		<<case "brush">>
			"Oh? A brush?" Poppy runs <<his>> fingers over the bristles. You nod.
			<br><br>
			"You have really nice <<if $awarelevel gte 5>>fur<<else>>hair<</if>>, I hope this brush can help you maintain it better." You glance at Poppy's crimson <<if $awarelevel gte 5>>fur<<else>>locks<</if>>.
			<br><br>
			"That's very thoughtful, thank you!" Poppy smiles, but <<he>> glances over your shoulder as if hoping there are more gifts for <<him>>.
			<<npcincr Poppy patience -2>><<lpatience>>
			<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
			<<poppyChristmasGiftReturn>>
		<<case "camera">>
			"Oh my!" Poppy exclaims as <<he>> pulls out the polaroid camera.
			<br><br>
			"I noticed how much you like to take photos," you say. "So I thought this gift would be fitting."
			<br><br>
			"That's so sweet of you. I was just about to get a new camera too! This... would not be the one I'd usually buy, but it'll do!"
			<<npcincr Poppy love 2>><<glove>><<npcincr Poppy patience 2>><<gpatience>>
			<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
			<<poppyChristmasGiftReturn>>
		<<case "perfume">>
			"Ooh!" Poppy's smile widens as <<he>> pulls out the bottle of perfume.
			<br><br>
			"When I smelt this perfume, I thought about you," you say.
			<br><br>
			"What a flirt you are, my jewel." Poppy teases. You watch <<him>> spray the perfume on <<himself>> a few times.
			<br><br>
			"Mhm... it smells really nice, you have good taste. Thank you for this lovely gift." Poppy kisses you on the cheek.
			<<npcincr Poppy love 2>><<glove>><<npcincr Poppy patience 4>><<ggpatience>><<garousal>><<arousal 600>>
			<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
			<<poppyChristmasGiftReturn>>
		<<case "tuxedo">>
			<<poppyChristmasTuxedoOpener>>
			<<if _poppyGiftAtFlat>>
				"I'll go put it on. You be a good <<girl>> and wait here."
				<br><br>
				Poppy enters <<his>> room. After a moment, <<he>> comes out wearing the suit. <<He>> gives you a little twirl. "So? What do you think?" <<He>> giggles.
				<br><br>
				<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Compliment|Poppy Christmas Tuxedo Compliment]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><<glove>><<gggpatience>><<garousal>>
				<br>
				<<socialiseicon "angry">><<link [[Insult|Poppy Christmas Tuxedo Insult]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><<llove>><<llpatience>>
			<<else>>
				"Thank you for this lovely gift, my jewel. I will try it on when I get back home." Poppy gives you a big fat smooch on the lips.
				<<npcincr Poppy love 3>><<glove>><<npcincr Poppy patience 6>><<gggpatience>><<garousal>><<arousal 600>>
				<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
				<<poppyChristmasGiftReturn>>
			<</if>>
		<<default>>
			<<He>> thanks you warmly for it.
			<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
			<<poppyChristmasGiftReturn>>
	<</switch>>
<</if>>
<br<

:: Poppy Christmas Tuxedo Compliment
<<set $location to "flats">><<set $bus to "poppy_living_room">>
<<effects>><<run poppySchedule()>>
"You look handsome." You take a step closer to admire Poppy's attire.
<br><br>
"Hehe, I should wear it more often, since it's a gift from you. Thank you, my jewel. You're the best." Poppy gives you a big fat smooch on the lips.
<<npcincr Poppy love 1>><<glove>><<npcincr Poppy patience 3>><<gggpatience>><<garousal>><<arousal 600>>
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<poppyChristmasGiftReturn>>
<br>

:: Poppy Christmas Tuxedo Insult
<<set $location to "flats">><<set $bus to "poppy_living_room">>
<<effects>><<run poppySchedule()>>
"It didn't look as great as I thought..." You say with a shake of your head.
<br><br>
Poppy pouts. "I thought it looked really good..."
<<npcincr Poppy love -3>><<llove>><<npcincr Poppy patience -3>><<llpatience>>
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<br>
